    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "So I hit upon a genius idea! If the Resistance and the Miniknog could just talk it out, then maybe things could get smoothed over. I'm sure Big Ape is not the villain they think, if only they'd get to know him. So I tunnelled out of my room and found the nearest Miniknog platoon.",
    "value": "于是我突然想到了一个天才般的主意！如果抵抗组织和科技发展部能坐下来好好谈谈，也许所有问题就能迎刃而解了。我敢肯定，老大猿并非他们想象的那种恶棍，只要他们愿意了解他就好了。所以，我从房间挖了条隧道溜出去，找到了最近的一支科技发展部小队。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Filled with positivity, I led them to the Resistance hideout and told them that if they didn't sort out their differences, I'd knock their heads together. So smart! Well, I think it went okay! I didn't stick around to find out for sure, of course, I had to meet back up with Greenfinger, but I saw them all marching together through the town square as we left.",
    "value": "我满怀积极向上的精神，带领他们到了抵抗组织的藏身处，并告诉他们，要是不能自行解决分歧，我就把他们的脑袋撞到一块儿去。这招太高明了！嗯，我觉得效果还不错！当然，我没留下来确认最终结果，因为我得赶去和绿手指会合，但我们离开时，我看到他们正一起列队穿过城镇广场。"
